- **Accent system:** `.accent` / `.accent--deep` in headlines; `.headline-rule` under section titles (48px orange bar)
- **Haas Relationship:** watermark in `.haas-relationship__bg` (static, intro only). Current homepage (`7306:1063`) has **no** 4-col features band — do not re-add. Features CSS (`7080:2240`) may remain unused on home.
- **News (homepage):** `.news-editorial` split — photo lead `.news-feature` + numbered `.news-item` rows; keep `.news-card` on ES/showroom
- **Testimonials:** `partials/testimonials-block.html` → `.testimonial-grid` + refreshed `.testimonial-card` (orange top rule, quote watermark, Barlow name); not carousel
- **Display type:** Barlow Condensed for headlines/card titles/numerals; Navigo for body/UI
- **Feature icon tiles:** 40×40 `--clr-gray-card` square (4px radius), 18px black/ink stroke icons — shared by `.haas-relationship__icon`, `.category-card__icon`, `.why-feature__icon`
- **Figma nodes:** Homepage handoff **`7306:1063`** (canvas `6573:406`); Haas intro `7080:1405`; features `7080:2240` not on current home. Full detail in `AGENTS.md`.

## Local preview

Run **Tasks: Run Task → Serve Gerotech (8080)** or `python3 -m http.server 8080` from repo root.

If connection refused or empty response: `kill $(lsof -t -iTCP:8080 -sTCP:LISTEN)` then restart.

## Figma

Paste a frame/layer link with `node-id`. Use `get_design_context`, then adapt to this project's HTML/BEM/tokens — not React/Tailwind verbatim.
